{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32406","headline":"敬荅李先生 · 温庭筠","name":"敬荅李先生","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"七里滩声舜庙前，杏花初盛草芊芊。\n绿昏晴气春风岸，红漾轻纶野水天。\n不爲伤离成极望，更因行乐惜流年。\n一瓢无事麛裘暖，手弄溪波坐钓船。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"温庭筠","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_32406.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32406","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}